1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,283
这是一台云上的全新电脑
Here's a brand-new computer in the cloud.

2
00:00:02,603 --> 00:00:05,803
它是我们的，有 root 权限，也就是完整的管理员权限
It's ours, and we have root, full administrator rights.

3
00:00:06,123 --> 00:00:09,600
我们让 pip 装两个 Python 包，pip 说不行
We ask pip for two Python packages, and pip says no.

4
00:00:10,083 --> 00:00:14,648
这条命令不是 README 里的，是我们大多数人最先会敲的那条
This command isn't from the README; it's the one most of us would type first.

5
00:00:14,968 --> 00:00:18,373
报错说这个环境是 externally managed（由外部管理）
The error says the environment is externally managed,

6
00:00:18,373 --> 00:00:20,622
还建议用虚拟环境
and suggests a virtual environment.

7
00:00:20,942 --> 00:00:24,163
看完这个视频，报错的每一行你都会看懂
By the end of this video, every line of it will make sense.

8
00:00:24,900 --> 00:00:28,015
今天这节课，“虚拟”这个词会出现两次
Today's lecture uses the word virtual twice.

9
00:00:28,335 --> 00:00:32,132
虚拟机，就是一整台你租来、用完就扔的电脑
A virtual machine is a whole computer you rent and throw away.

10
00:00:32,452 --> 00:00:37,529
虚拟环境，就是给一个项目专用的一套 Python 包
A virtual environment is a private set of Python packages for one project.

11
00:00:37,849 --> 00:00:39,727
而且，一个会装在另一个里面
And one will live inside the other.

12
00:00:39,967 --> 00:00:42,531
这个教程叫 simple-translate
The tutorial, simple-translate, runs one small app four ways, each removing a kind of fragility.

13
00:00:42,531 --> 00:00:46,708
它用四种方式跑同一个小应用，每一种都去掉一类隐患
The tutorial, simple-translate, runs one small app four ways, each removing a kind of fragility.

14
00:00:47,028 --> 00:00:49,713
今天我们爬前两级
Today we climb the first two rungs:

15
00:00:49,713 --> 00:00:55,391
先在云端 VM 上手动安装，再换一台同样配置的全新 VM，改用 uv
a manual install on a cloud VM, then a fresh VM of the same kind, with uv.

16
00:00:55,711 --> 00:00:57,439
Docker 留到下节课
Docker comes next lecture.

17
00:00:57,683 --> 00:01:00,926
想跟着做的话，把 README 打开，放在视频旁边
To follow along, open the README beside this video.

18
00:01:01,246 --> 00:01:03,976
左上角的进度条显示 README 的步骤
The tracker, top left, shows the README step.

19
00:01:04,296 --> 00:01:06,814
代码面板会标出文件和行号
Code panels show the file and line numbers.

20
00:01:07,134 --> 00:01:09,494
看到黄色的“轮到你了”标签，就暂停
When the yellow your-turn tag appears,

21
00:01:09,494 --> 00:01:12,040
在你自己的 VM 上跑这条命令
pause and run the command on your own VM.

22
00:01:12,360 --> 00:01:16,181
灰色的“额外”标签表示这条命令 README 里没有
A grey extra tag marks a command that isn't in the README;

23
00:01:16,181 --> 00:01:18,355
额外的命令都是安全的，也一起跑吧
extras are safe, so run them too.

24
00:01:18,675 --> 00:01:23,326
每条命令也都在学习指南里，在 MLOps Learning 这个 repo 里
Every command is also in the study guide, in the MLOps Learning repo.

25
00:01:23,567 --> 00:01:25,880
开始前先做完 Tutorial 0
Before you start, finish Tutorial 0,

26
00:01:25,880 --> 00:01:29,156
这样你就有一个 Google Cloud 项目，结算也开好了
so you have a Google Cloud project with billing on.

27
00:01:29,476 --> 00:01:33,380
今天不用服务账号，也不用密钥，有个浏览器就行
No service account or keys today; all you need is a browser.

28
00:01:34,417 --> 00:01:37,596
装东西之前，先看看要装的是什么
Before we install anything, let's see what we're installing.

29
00:01:37,916 --> 00:01:42,481
在 GitHub 上打开 cli.py，待会儿你会把它 clone 到 VM 上
Open cli.py on GitHub; you'll clone it onto your VM soon.

30
00:01:42,801 --> 00:01:47,068
前两个 import，argparse 和 asyncio，是 Python 自带的
The first two imports, argparse and asyncio, come with Python.

31
00:01:47,388 --> 00:01:50,033
后两个，art 和 googletrans，就不是了
The next two, art and googletrans, don't.

32
00:01:50,353 --> 00:01:51,953
它们总得从某个地方来
They have to come from somewhere.

33
00:01:52,273 --> 00:01:55,004
这整节课，讲的就是它们从哪儿来
This whole lecture is about where they come from.

34
00:01:55,250 --> 00:01:59,695
这个 main 函数先打印一个横幅，用 ASCII 字符画写着 AC215
The main function prints a banner that says AC215 in ASCII art,

35
00:01:59,695 --> 00:02:03,506
然后是解析好的参数，最后是要翻译的文本
then the parsed arguments, then the text to translate.

36
00:02:03,826 --> 00:02:08,008
如果用 -f 传一个文件，文本就改从那个文件里读
If you pass a file with -f, the text comes from that file instead.

37
00:02:08,250 --> 00:02:13,316
最下面，argparse 定义了四个选项，各有默认值
At the bottom, argparse defines four options, and each one has a default:

38
00:02:13,316 --> 00:02:18,106
文本是 I love cheese，源语言是英语，目标语言是意大利语
the text I love cheese, source language English, destination Italian.

39
00:02:18,426 --> 00:02:21,242
所以不带任何选项运行 cli.py
So running cli.py with no options

40
00:02:21,242 --> 00:02:24,485
就会把 I love cheese 翻译成意大利语
translates I love cheese into Italian.

41
00:02:24,734 --> 00:02:27,980
最后一行启动事件循环并运行 main
The last line starts an event loop and runs main,

42
00:02:27,980 --> 00:02:31,027
因为 googletrans 4 是异步的
because googletrans version 4 is asynchronous.

43
00:02:31,347 --> 00:02:34,356
在 main 里，一个 Translator 把你的文本发出去
Inside main, a Translator sends your text off

44
00:02:34,356 --> 00:02:35,956
只用一次 await 调用
with one awaited call.

45
00:02:36,067 --> 00:02:39,531
这次调用就是一个 HTTPS 请求
That call is a single HTTPS request

46
00:02:39,531 --> 00:02:43,491
从 VM 发到 translate.googleapis.com
from the VM to translate.googleapis.com.

47
00:02:43,811 --> 00:02:47,350
这是 Google 非官方的翻译接口
It's Google's unofficial translate endpoint:

48
00:02:47,350 --> 00:02:49,763
免费，不用 API key，也不做任何保证
free, no API key, no promises.

49
00:02:50,083 --> 00:02:54,584
返回来一小段 JSON，第 39 行把译文打印出来
A little JSON comes back, and line 39 prints the translation.

50
00:02:54,834 --> 00:02:59,869
第 25 行有个细节以后会用到：raise_exception=True
One detail on line 25 matters later: raise_exception=True.

51
00:03:00,189 --> 00:03:03,041
没有它的话，Google 一旦返回错误
Without it, when Google answers with an error,

52
00:03:03,041 --> 00:03:06,141
googletrans 就把错误藏起来
googletrans hides it and hands your own input back

53
00:03:06,141 --> 00:03:08,807
把你的原文当成译文交回来，看上去一切正常
as the translation, so nothing looks wrong.

54
00:03:09,127 --> 00:03:11,986
有了它，失败就会变成一条你能看懂的报错
With it, a failure becomes an error you can read.

55
00:03:12,234 --> 00:03:15,424
第 32 到 37 行会接住那次调用的任何错误
Lines 32 to 37 catch any error from that call

56
00:03:15,424 --> 00:03:19,253
再包装成一条更友好的消息，说是网络的问题
and wrap it in a friendlier message about the network.

57
00:03:19,573 --> 00:03:21,165
记住这几行
Remember these lines.

58
00:03:21,215 --> 00:03:23,092
几分钟后，它们就会误导我们
In a few minutes, they'll fool us.

59
00:03:23,400 --> 00:03:27,837
所以这个应用很小：参数进去，一次网络请求，一行输出
So the app is small: arguments in, one web request, one line out.

60
00:03:28,157 --> 00:03:30,781
它需要的，是两个第三方包
What it needs is two third-party packages.

61
00:03:31,101 --> 00:03:33,576
我们去弄一台电脑，给它们安个家
Let's get a computer, and find them a home.

62
00:03:34,817 --> 00:03:37,784
虚拟机就是一台真实服务器切出来的一片
A virtual machine is a slice of a real server

63
00:03:37,784 --> 00:03:39,894
在 Google 的某个数据中心里
in one of Google's data centers.

64
00:03:40,214 --> 00:03:42,441
有一种软件叫 hypervisor（虚拟机监控器）
Software called a hypervisor

65
00:03:42,441 --> 00:03:44,225
它把这台机器切成一片一片
carves the machine into slices.

66
00:03:44,545 --> 00:03:48,310
每一片都从这台服务器分到虚拟 CPU 和内存
Each slice gets virtual CPUs and memory from that server,

67
00:03:48,310 --> 00:03:52,737
从 Google 的存储网络分到一块磁盘，还有自己的操作系统
a disk from Google's storage network, and its own operating system.

68
00:03:53,057 --> 00:03:54,657
其中一片会是你的
One of them will be yours.

69
00:03:54,884 --> 00:03:59,719
在控制台里，先确认选中的是你在 Tutorial 0 建的项目
In the console, check that your Tutorial 0 project is selected,

70
00:03:59,719 --> 00:04:03,097
然后打开 Compute Engine，再进 VM instances
then open Compute Engine, then VM instances.

71
00:04:03,417 --> 00:04:07,666
第一次进去，它可能会让你启用 Compute Engine API
The first time, it may ask you to enable the Compute Engine API;

72
00:04:07,666 --> 00:04:09,924
点 Enable，再等它一分钟
click enable and give it a minute.

73
00:04:10,244 --> 00:04:11,844
然后点 Create instance
Then click Create instance.

74
00:04:12,084 --> 00:04:15,455
README 没给任何设置，这里给一套合理的选择
The README gives no settings, so here are sensible ones.

75
00:04:15,775 --> 00:04:18,676
名称，比如 ac215-l01
A name, like ac215-l01.

76
00:04:18,996 --> 00:04:22,196
区域和可用区，就是这台机器实际放在哪里
A region and zone: where the machine physically lives.

77
00:04:22,516 --> 00:04:27,465
机器类型决定 CPU 和内存，e2-small 就够用了
A machine type, which sets the CPUs and memory; e2-small is plenty.

78
00:04:27,785 --> 00:04:29,897
启动磁盘选 Debian 12
And a boot disk with Debian 12.

79
00:04:30,217 --> 00:04:33,801
用 Debian 13 也行，后面会看到它在哪些地方不一样
Debian 13 works too; we'll see where it changes things.

80
00:04:34,050 --> 00:04:37,378
保留外部 IP（也就是公网 IP），它默认就是开着的
Keep the external IP address; it's on by default.

81
00:04:37,698 --> 00:04:40,464
没有它，又没做额外的网络配置
Without it, and without extra network setup,

82
00:04:40,464 --> 00:04:44,802
这台 VM 就上不了网，这里的每次下载都会卡住
this VM can't reach the internet, and every download here would hang.

83
00:04:45,050 --> 00:04:46,650
现在，计价器开始跳了
And now the meter starts.

84
00:04:46,927 --> 00:04:52,858
CPU 和内存在 VM 运行期间按秒计费，闲着也照样算
CPU and memory are billed by the second while the VM runs, even when it sits idle.

85
00:04:53,178 --> 00:04:55,631
磁盘只要还在，就一直计费
The disk is billed for as long as it exists.

86
00:04:55,951 --> 00:04:59,578
费用估算不高，但计价器自己不会停
The estimate is small, but the meter never stops on its own.

87
00:04:59,834 --> 00:05:03,418
点 Create，等绿勾出现，再点 SSH
Click Create, wait for the green check, then click SSH.

88
00:05:03,738 --> 00:05:07,215
要是让你授权这次连接，就点 Authorize
If it asks you to authorize the connection, click Authorize.

89
00:05:07,535 --> 00:05:11,375
浏览器里会打开一个终端，已经登录到新 VM 上
A terminal opens in your browser, logged in to your new VM.

90
00:05:11,695 --> 00:05:14,981
我们的提示符显示 student，你的是你自己的用户名
Our prompt says student; yours shows your own username.

91
00:05:15,301 --> 00:05:17,796
先在这里暂停，把你的 VM 也弄到这一步
Pause here, and get your VM to this point.

92
00:05:18,050 --> 00:05:20,823
来做三个快速的额外检查，README 里都没有
Three quick extra checks, not in the README.

93
00:05:21,143 --> 00:05:23,789
第一，我们拿到的是哪个操作系统？
First, which operating system did we get?

94
00:05:24,109 --> 00:05:28,120
打印 os-release 文件：Debian 12，代号 bookworm
Print the os-release file: Debian 12, nicknamed bookworm.

95
00:05:28,384 --> 00:05:30,987
第二，再问一下 python3 的版本
Second, ask python3 for its version.

96
00:05:31,307 --> 00:05:36,960
Debian 12 自带 Python 3.11.2，给操作系统自己用
Debian 12 ships Python 3.11.2, for the operating system itself.

97
00:05:37,280 --> 00:05:40,992
换成 Debian 13，你会看到 3.13.5
On Debian 13, you'd see 3.13.5.

98
00:05:41,312 --> 00:05:42,976
这两个数字都记住
Keep both numbers in mind.

99
00:05:43,234 --> 00:05:45,623
第三，which python，不带 3
Third, which python, without the 3.

100
00:05:45,943 --> 00:05:48,930
这个 which 命令，查一个名字会运行哪个程序
The which command asks which program a name would run.

101
00:05:49,250 --> 00:05:53,943
查 python，什么都没返回：Debian 有 python3，但没有 python
For python, nothing comes back: Debian has python3, but no python.

102
00:05:54,263 --> 00:05:55,970
记住它，第二部分要用
Remember this for part 2.

103
00:05:57,033 --> 00:05:59,550
第 3 步：输入 sudo apt-get update
Step 3: type sudo apt-get update.

104
00:05:59,870 --> 00:06:04,436
Debian 的包管理器是 apt，sudo 让它以管理员身份运行
Debian's package manager is apt, and sudo runs it as the administrator.

105
00:06:04,756 --> 00:06:07,100
而 update 会下载软件包列表
Update downloads the package catalog:

106
00:06:07,100 --> 00:06:10,836
有哪些软件包，各自最新的版本是什么
the list of packages that exist, and their latest versions.

107
00:06:11,156 --> 00:06:12,820
这时还什么都没装
Nothing is installed yet.

108
00:06:13,140 --> 00:06:15,944
在 Google 的 VM 上，你会看到多出几行
On a Google VM, you'll see a few more lines,

109
00:06:15,944 --> 00:06:18,046
那是 Google 自己的软件源
for Google's own package sources.

110
00:06:18,366 --> 00:06:19,716
暂停一下，自己跑一遍
Pause and run it.

111
00:06:19,766 --> 00:06:23,670
这里 README 有个提示：apt-get 和 apt 做的是同一件事
The README has a tip here: apt-get and apt do the same job.

112
00:06:23,990 --> 00:06:27,325
其中 apt-get 这条命令稳定、适合写进脚本
The apt-get command is the stable, scriptable one,

113
00:06:27,325 --> 00:06:29,793
用在 Dockerfile 和自动化构建里
for Dockerfiles and automated builds.

114
00:06:30,113 --> 00:06:33,035
短一点的 apt，手敲起来更友好
The shorter apt is friendlier for typing by hand.

115
00:06:33,355 --> 00:06:34,866
这里用哪个都行
Either is fine here.

116
00:06:34,916 --> 00:06:37,305
第 4 步：sudo apt install git
Step 4: sudo apt install git.

117
00:06:37,625 --> 00:06:39,844
这次 apt 是真的要装东西了
This time apt really installs things.

118
00:06:40,164 --> 00:06:43,556
它会列出要添加的东西，然后问你：要继续吗？
It lists what it will add and asks, do you want to continue?

119
00:06:43,876 --> 00:06:45,476
输入 Y，按回车
Type Y and press enter.

120
00:06:45,775 --> 00:06:50,020
列表因 VM 而异；如果已经有 git，apt 会直接告诉你
The list depends on your VM; if git is already there, apt says so.

121
00:06:50,340 --> 00:06:51,683
暂停一下，自己跑一遍
Pause and run it.

122
00:06:51,733 --> 00:06:53,610
第 5 步：把 repo clone 下来
Step 5: clone the repo.

123
00:06:53,930 --> 00:06:57,322
输入 git clone，再加上地址；地址从 README 里复制
Type git clone, then the address; copy it from the README.

124
00:06:57,642 --> 00:06:59,398
它会把整个 repo 连同历史
Git copies the whole repo,

125
00:06:59,398 --> 00:07:03,044
复制到一个新目录 simple-translate 里
with its history, into a new folder, simple-translate,

126
00:07:03,044 --> 00:07:04,644
就在你的 home 目录下
in your home directory.

127
00:07:04,833 --> 00:07:07,244
第 6 步：cd simple-translate
Step 6: cd simple-translate.

128
00:07:07,564 --> 00:07:11,745
注意看提示符：冒号后面现在显示你所在的目录
Watch the prompt: after the colon, it now shows the folder you're in.

129
00:07:12,065 --> 00:07:14,604
这个波浪号代表你的 home 目录
The wavy tilde means your home folder.

130
00:07:14,924 --> 00:07:16,630
暂停一下，跟上进度
Pause, and catch up to here.

131
00:07:16,866 --> 00:07:19,575
额外检查一下：用 ls 列出文件
One extra check: ls lists the files.

132
00:07:19,895 --> 00:07:21,395
里面有 cli.py、README
There's cli.py,

133
00:07:21,395 --> 00:07:24,510
一个存成文本文件的 Dockerfile
the README, a Dockerfile saved as a text file,

134
00:07:24,510 --> 00:07:28,217
两个下节课用的脚本，还有 pyproject.toml
two scripts for next lecture, and pyproject.toml,

135
00:07:28,217 --> 00:07:30,562
列着这个应用需要什么
the list of what the app needs.

136
00:07:30,882 --> 00:07:33,872
注意少了什么：没有 requirements 文件
Notice what's missing: no requirements file,

137
00:07:33,872 --> 00:07:36,386
也没有记录精确版本的 lock 文件
and no lock file with exact versions.

138
00:07:36,706 --> 00:07:38,306
先记住这一点
Hold on to that.

139
00:07:39,167 --> 00:07:42,324
第 7 步：sudo apt install python3-pip
Step 7: sudo apt install python3-pip.

140
00:07:42,644 --> 00:07:46,570
这是 Debian 自己打包的 pip，给 Debian 的 Python 用
That's Debian's own packaged copy of pip, for Debian's Python.

141
00:07:46,890 --> 00:07:48,440
再输入一次 Y
Answer Y again.

142
00:07:48,490 --> 00:07:53,375
我们这次连带装了一百多个软件包；真正的 VM 上通常会少一些
Ours pulled in over a hundred packages; a real VM usually needs fewer.

143
00:07:53,695 --> 00:07:55,034
暂停一下，自己跑一遍
Pause and run it.

144
00:07:55,084 --> 00:07:58,135
额外检查一下：问问 pip3 的版本
An extra check: ask pip3 for its version.

145
00:07:58,455 --> 00:08:01,679
它是 pip 23.0.1，对应 Python 3.11
It's pip 23.0.1, for Python 3.11,

146
00:08:01,679 --> 00:08:06,369
在 /usr/lib 下面一个叫 dist-packages 的目录里
in a folder called dist-packages under /usr/lib.

147
00:08:06,689 --> 00:08:11,297
这个 user 拼作 usr：指的是系统的文件，不是你的 home 目录
That user is spelled usr: the system's files, not your home folder.

148
00:08:11,534 --> 00:08:15,939
现在跑视频开头那条命令，不带 sudo，也不带任何参数
Now the command from the start of the video, without sudo or any flag;

149
00:08:15,939 --> 00:08:17,827
它也不在 README 里
it isn't in the README either.

150
00:08:18,147 --> 00:08:22,371
还是一样，pip 拒绝了：这个环境是 externally managed
Again, pip refuses: this environment is externally managed.

151
00:08:22,691 --> 00:08:26,851
提示说：用 apt 安装，或者建一个虚拟环境
The hint says: install with apt, or create a virtual environment.

152
00:08:27,171 --> 00:08:29,966
它最后一句甚至给出了绕过去的办法
Its last note even names a way around it.

153
00:08:30,200 --> 00:08:31,537
为什么要拒绝？
Why refuse?

154
00:08:31,587 --> 00:08:33,805
先想想 Python 怎么找 import 的东西
Picture how Python finds an import.

155
00:08:34,125 --> 00:08:37,699
这条额外的一行命令打印 sys.path 这个列表
This extra one-liner prints the list called sys.path:

156
00:08:37,699 --> 00:08:39,587
也就是 Python 会搜索的那些目录
the folders Python searches.

157
00:08:39,907 --> 00:08:41,507
把它们想成一层层的架子
Think of them as shelves.

158
00:08:41,656 --> 00:08:46,755
每次 import，Python 都从最上面一层往下找，拿第一个对上的
On every import, Python scans from the top shelf down, and takes the first match.

159
00:08:47,967 --> 00:08:49,930
最下面这层是 apt 的
The bottom shelf belongs to apt.

160
00:08:50,250 --> 00:08:52,442
Debian 自己也在跑一些 Python 工具
Debian itself runs Python tools

161
00:08:52,442 --> 00:08:56,756
它们依赖的正是这些罐子，而且正是这些版本
that depend on exactly those jars, at exactly those versions.

162
00:08:57,076 --> 00:09:00,831
系统 Python 是一间公用厨房，掌勺的是 apt
The system Python is a shared kitchen, and apt is the cook.

163
00:09:01,151 --> 00:09:03,242
这就是 externally managed 的意思
That's what externally managed means.

164
00:09:03,562 --> 00:09:07,082
而 PEP 668 就是让 pip 遵守这一点的规则
PEP 668 is the rule that makes pip respect it.

165
00:09:07,317 --> 00:09:10,953
第 8 步是 README 里的命令：sudo pip3 install
Step 8 is the README's command: sudo pip3 install,

166
00:09:10,953 --> 00:09:13,717
加上 --break-system-packages 这个参数
with the flag --break-system-packages.

167
00:09:14,037 --> 00:09:18,453
这个参数绕过了保护；sudo 让 pip 以管理员身份写文件
The flag overrides the guard; sudo lets pip write as administrator.

168
00:09:18,773 --> 00:09:20,195
暂停一下，自己跑一遍
Pause and run it.

169
00:09:20,245 --> 00:09:22,693
我们要了 2 个包，装了 12 个
We asked for 2 packages and got 12;

170
00:09:22,693 --> 00:09:25,771
如果你看到 requirement already satisfied
if yours says requirement already satisfied,

171
00:09:25,771 --> 00:09:27,520
说明 apt 已经装过那个包了
apt already had that one.

172
00:09:27,840 --> 00:09:30,176
还有，警告说以 root 身份运行 pip
And the warning says running pip as root

173
00:09:30,176 --> 00:09:32,746
可能会和系统的包管理器冲突
can clash with the system's package manager.

174
00:09:32,984 --> 00:09:34,385
它们装到哪儿去了？
Where did they go?

175
00:09:34,435 --> 00:09:38,171
这条额外的一行命令问 googletrans 装在哪儿
This extra one-liner asks googletrans where it lives:

176
00:09:38,171 --> 00:09:40,568
在 /usr/local 下面的 dist-packages 里
in dist-packages under /usr/local,

177
00:09:40,568 --> 00:09:43,459
仍然是系统的，所有用户共用
still the system's, shared by every user.

178
00:09:43,779 --> 00:09:47,256
看看这些架子：这一层在 apt 那层的上面
Look at the shelves: that shelf sits above the one apt owns.

179
00:09:47,500 --> 00:09:52,556
现在假设，apt 之前为某个系统工具装过一个旧版的 httpx
Now suppose apt had installed an older httpx for some system tool.

180
00:09:52,876 --> 00:09:55,965
我们的 googletrans 需要 0.27.2 及以上
Our googletrans needs 0.27.2 or newer,

181
00:09:55,965 --> 00:10:00,193
所以 pip 会再装一份，放在更高的那层架子上
so pip would add a second copy, on the higher shelf.

182
00:10:00,513 --> 00:10:04,469
这时 Python 会先找到这一份，把 apt 那份挡住
Python would find that copy first and hide the one from apt,

183
00:10:04,469 --> 00:10:08,492
所有用系统 Python 的程序都这样，不只是我们的
for every program that uses the system Python, not just ours.

184
00:10:08,812 --> 00:10:10,412
这个参数破坏的，正是这一点
That's what the flag breaks.

185
00:10:10,567 --> 00:10:14,190
公平地说，README 里也讲了，这里是故意用这个参数
To be fair, the README says it uses the flag deliberately,

186
00:10:14,190 --> 00:10:18,439
当作快速演示，下一部分就会用正规的做法
as a quick demonstration, and the next walkthrough does it properly.

187
00:10:18,684 --> 00:10:20,284
来想一个问题
Something to ponder.

188
00:10:20,348 --> 00:10:26,526
这台 VM 上有个同学的项目，需要 httpx 0.13
A classmate's project on this VM needs httpx 0.13,

189
00:10:26,526 --> 00:10:29,863
而你的项目，需要的是 httpx 0.28
and yours needs httpx 0.28.

190
00:10:30,183 --> 00:10:32,423
两个项目都像这样，做系统级安装
Both install system-wide, like this.

191
00:10:32,743 --> 00:10:34,343
会怎么样？
What happens?

192
00:10:42,584 --> 00:10:46,808
架子只有一层，所以只放得下一个 httpx
There's only one shelf, so there's room for only one httpx.

193
00:10:47,128 --> 00:10:51,608
最后装的说了算，对所有人都一样，两个项目总有一个会坏
The last install wins, for everyone, and one of the two projects breaks.

194
00:10:53,150 --> 00:10:54,750
第 9 步：把它跑起来
Step 9: run it.

195
00:10:54,921 --> 00:11:00,809
输入 python3 cli.py，要带 3，因为这里没有不带 3 的 python
Type python3 cli.py, with the 3, since plain python doesn't exist here.

196
00:11:01,129 --> 00:11:05,359
你应该会看到横幅、参数、你的输入，还有输出
You should see the banner, the arguments, your input, and the output:

197
00:11:05,359 --> 00:11:06,959
意大利语版的 I love cheese
I love cheese, in Italian.

198
00:11:07,273 --> 00:11:10,734
要是出来一大段红色报错，什么都别改
If you get a long red error instead, don't change anything;

199
00:11:10,734 --> 00:11:12,905
待会儿我们一起读我们录到的那段
we'll read ours together in a minute.

200
00:11:13,225 --> 00:11:14,617
暂停一下，试试看
Pause and try it.

201
00:11:14,667 --> 00:11:16,608
然后跑 README 里的另外两条命令
Then the README's other two runs.

202
00:11:16,928 --> 00:11:22,112
其中 -t 指定文本，-s 指定源语言，-d 指定目标语言
-t gives the text, -s the source language, -d the destination.

203
00:11:22,432 --> 00:11:26,443
从 README 复制，连引号一起，暂停一下，两条都跑一遍
Copy them from the README, quotes included, and pause to run both.

204
00:11:26,763 --> 00:11:29,557
一条返回西班牙语，另一条返回法语
One comes back in Spanish, the other in French.

205
00:11:29,800 --> 00:11:34,252
说实话，我们录的时候，Google 拒绝了我们的请求
Now, honestly: when we recorded this, Google refused our requests,

206
00:11:34,252 --> 00:11:37,288
结果跑出来这一长串红色的 traceback
and the run ended in this long red traceback.

207
00:11:37,608 --> 00:11:40,915
我们来读一读，这种 traceback 整门课你都会碰到
Let's read it; you'll meet tracebacks like this all course long.

208
00:11:41,150 --> 00:11:43,625
这是一个链式 traceback：两个错误
This is a chained traceback: two errors.

209
00:11:43,945 --> 00:11:47,913
中间那一行说，第一个错误直接导致了第二个
The line between them says the first one directly caused the second.

210
00:11:48,233 --> 00:11:52,222
大多数人只看最后一行，可这里它只是外层包装
Most people read only the last line, but here that's just the wrapper.

211
00:11:52,542 --> 00:11:55,166
往上翻到第一个错误：那才是原因
Scroll up to the first error: that's the cause.

212
00:11:55,400 --> 00:11:59,539
原因是状态码 429，也就是请求太多
The cause is status code 429: too many requests.

213
00:11:59,859 --> 00:12:03,687
Google 的非官方接口在对我们的机器限流
Google's unofficial endpoint was rate-limiting our machine,

214
00:12:03,687 --> 00:12:06,088
对云上的机器，它经常这样
as it often does with cloud machines.

215
00:12:06,408 --> 00:12:09,478
这台 VM 上什么都没坏。最后一行的错误
Nothing on the VM was broken. The error

216
00:12:09,478 --> 00:12:15,488
是这个应用自己的外层包装，也就是 cli.py 的第 32 到 37 行
on the last line is the app's own wrapper, lines 32 to 37 of cli.py.

217
00:12:15,808 --> 00:12:20,566
它什么都接住，再抛出一条更友好的消息，接在原来的错误后面
It catches anything, and raises a friendlier message, chained to the original.

218
00:12:20,800 --> 00:12:22,400
为什么要看第一个错误？
Why read the first error?

219
00:12:22,592 --> 00:12:26,496
这条额外的命令故意打错了：xx 不是一种语言
This extra command has a typo: xx isn't a language.

220
00:12:26,816 --> 00:12:30,016
第一个错误说的是：目标语言无效
The first error says invalid destination language.

221
00:12:30,336 --> 00:12:35,435
但最后一行还是在怪网络，因为同一个外层包装什么都接
But the last line still blames the network, because the same wrapper catches everything.

222
00:12:35,755 --> 00:12:38,485
这是代码的小缺陷，不是你的配置有问题
A small flaw in the code, not in your setup.

223
00:12:38,805 --> 00:12:42,432
有效的语言代码，在 README 最下面的一张表里
The valid codes are in a table at the bottom of the README.

224
00:12:42,667 --> 00:12:45,329
如果你遇到 429，可以等一等再试
If you hit a 429, wait and retry,

225
00:12:45,329 --> 00:12:48,960
换个区域，或者在你的笔记本上跑
try another region, or run it on your laptop.

226
00:12:49,280 --> 00:12:53,430
只要走到了 Input 那一行，import 就都成功了
If you got as far as the Input line, the imports worked;

227
00:12:53,430 --> 00:12:57,579
第一个错误是 429 的话，说不行的只是网络
when the first error is a 429, only the network said no.

228
00:12:58,817 --> 00:13:01,654
第 10 步，也是最后一步：把 VM 删掉
Step 10, the last one: delete the VM.

229
00:13:01,974 --> 00:13:06,582
README 也说了，运行中的 VM 会一直计费，闲着也一样
As the README says, a running VM keeps charging, even when idle.

230
00:13:06,902 --> 00:13:09,313
那为什么要删除，而不只是停止？
So why delete it, and not just stop it?

231
00:13:09,550 --> 00:13:15,797
停止之后，CPU 和内存不再计费，但磁盘还在，所以还在计费
Stopping ends the billing for CPU and memory, but the disk still exists, so it keeps billing,

232
00:13:15,797 --> 00:13:18,148
预留的 IP 地址也一样
and so would a reserved IP address.

233
00:13:18,400 --> 00:13:23,029
删除会移除这台 VM，而且默认启动磁盘也一起删掉
Deleting removes the VM, and by default its boot disk goes with it.

234
00:13:23,349 --> 00:13:27,232
这是启动磁盘的一个设置，你没改过就是开着的
That's a setting on the boot disk, and it's on unless you changed it.

235
00:13:27,552 --> 00:13:29,152
计价器也就停了
And the meter stops.

236
00:13:29,237 --> 00:13:32,928
选中你的实例，点 Delete，暂停视频，等它删完
Select your instance, click Delete, and pause until it's gone.

237
00:13:33,167 --> 00:13:37,754
然后检查两个页面：VM instances 和 Disks 都应该是空的
Then check two pages: VM instances and Disks should both be empty.

238
00:13:38,074 --> 00:13:40,600
笔记本上装了 gcloud 命令行工具的话
With the gcloud tool on your laptop,

239
00:13:40,600 --> 00:13:44,950
两条额外的命令也能查：gcloud compute instances list
two extra commands do the same: gcloud compute instances list,

240
00:13:44,950 --> 00:13:47,055
还有 gcloud compute disks list
and gcloud compute disks list.

241
00:13:47,375 --> 00:13:49,103
这两条 README 里都没有
Neither is in the README.

242
00:13:49,350 --> 00:13:51,099
这就是简单粗暴的做法
That was the quick and dirty way.

243
00:13:51,419 --> 00:13:55,707
能用，但它改的是机器上每个程序都在用的系统 Python
It worked, but it changed the system Python for every program on the machine.

244
00:13:56,027 --> 00:13:59,846
第二部分：同一个应用，换台新 VM，用干净的做法
In part 2: the same app, on a fresh VM, the clean way.
